| `?` | Help (three-column layout) |
| `D` | Show inbox |
| `/` | Search bar |
| `t t` | Tag current thread |
| `t m` | Tag all marked threads |
| `` ` `` | Manual sync |
| `C-r` | Apply filter rules |
| `Q` | Quit |
| `h/l` | Previous/next tab |
| `x/X` | Close panel / close all |
| `c` | Compose |
| `I/U/F/T` | Show inbox / unread / flagged / tags |
| `j/k` | Next/previous thread (always, even from preview) |
| `s` | Mark thread and advance |
| `a` | Archive (current or all marked) |
| `d` | Delete (current or all marked) |
| `d d` | Empty trash (irreversible expunge) |
| `d u` | Restore from trash |
| `A` | Archive to local (current or all marked) |
| `1`-`9` | Toggle configured tag hotkey |

